==Battleground==
*5 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat (Enemy)|HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Zory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This is a somewhat easy stage. The Zombie enemies are rather weak, so any strong units such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Vaulter Cat]] can deal with them. [[HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat (Enemy)|HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat]] has 150,000 HP and 6,000 attack, making it rather bulky to deal with, but since it acts like [[HAPPI (Enemy)|its weaker counterpart]] it's easy to deal with.

